From ad1e4d08d0d80f18793050e5753e596d9c413e46 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 07:47:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Fix per-bank BVN modification prices and consent modal on
 older phones

Prices: BvnModificationPage keyed prices by enrollment type only, so every
bank showed whichever bank row came last (NIBSS) and Access Bank's own price
never appeared, even though the backend already stores and charges a price per
bank. Key by type + bank, take the bank list from the API, and show the bank
name next to the service cost.

Bulk pricing: the "BVN Modification - Banks/NIBSS" bulk reprice always
overwrote every bank row, wiping a bank's custom price. Add a bank checklist so
a bank can be left out (or repriced alone); bank-key logic is now shared in
lib/bvn-modification-banks.ts. Fix the stale price-list test and add per-bank
price/charge tests.

Mobile styling: Tailwind v4 emits its default palette as oklch(), which some
phones drop entirely, leaving white-on-white headers, black borders and
missing buttons. Pin the default palette to hex in index.css and define the
tokens components used but the theme never declared (gold-100/300, brand-100/
500, ink-400). Rebuild the consent modal as a bottom sheet with explicit hex
colours, stacked full-width buttons, and a z-index above the floating
WhatsApp/AI Help buttons. Remove a stray committed backup file.

